OL,3,GNEWSASchool attacker had IS image on
OL,4,Aphone, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy accused of trying to
OL,7,Fkill two children at a school in
OL,8,Fnorth-west London had a picture of an
OL,9,FIslamic State soldier prominently
OL,10,Fdisplayed on his phone, a court has
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FThe youth, who cannot be identified
OL,14,Fbecause of his age, took the image from
OL,15,Fa warfare video he reposted on TikTok
OL,16,Ffour days before he filmed himself
OL,17,Fstabbing the boys in the neck at
OL,18,FKingsbury High School in Brent on 10
OL,19,FFebruary, it was claimed.
